§§ `s 485C Restriction on appointment of auditor of private company which is a public interest entity`

-- src:6748 | (1) A person who has been, or will have been, auditor of a private company which is a public interest entity for every financial year comprised in the maximum engagement period (see section 494ZA) may not be appointed as auditor of the company for any financial year which begins within the period of 4 years beginning with the day after the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period.
@ref s 485C(1) The four years (src:6748-6748)
GIVEN `the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`s 485C(1) the first day of the period of 4 years` MEANS
    Date (Day `the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period` PLUS 1) -- "the day after the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period"

-- src:6748 | (1) A person who has been, or will have been, auditor of a private company which is a public interest entity for every financial year comprised in the maximum engagement period (see section 494ZA) may not be appointed as auditor of the company for any financial year which begins within the period of 4 years beginning with the day after the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period.
@ref s 485C(1) The four years (src:6748-6748)
GIVEN `the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`s 485C(1) the last day of the period of 4 years` MEANS
    -- "the period of 4 years beginning with the day after the last day": that day plus four years, less one day (fork F6)
    Date (Day (`add years` (`s 485C(1) the first day of the period of 4 years` `the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period`) 4) MINUS 1)

-- src:6748 | (1) A person who has been, or will have been, auditor of a private company which is a public interest entity for every financial year comprised in the maximum engagement period (see section 494ZA) may not be appointed as auditor of the company for any financial year which begins within the period of 4 years beginning with the day after the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period.
@ref s 485C(1) A person who has been auditor for every financial year of the maximum engagement period may not be appointed (src:6748-6748)
-- src:6750 | (3) This section does not apply in relation to an Auditor General.
@ref s 485C(3) This section does not apply in relation to an Auditor General (src:6750-6750)
GIVEN `the company is a private company that is a public interest entity` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the person has been, or will have been, auditor of the company for every financial year comprised in the maximum engagement period (section 494ZA)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period` IS A DATE
      `the first day of the financial year for which the appointment is proposed` IS A DATE
      `the appointment is of an Auditor General` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 485C(1) the person is barred from appointment as auditor of the company for the financial year` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the appointment is of an Auditor General`
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This section does not apply in relation to an Auditor General" (subsection (3))
        IF `the company is a private company that is a public interest entity` EQUALS JUST FALSE
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A person who has been, or will have been, auditor of a private company which is a public interest entity": the bar reaches only that company (fork F15)
        IF NOT `the person has been, or will have been, auditor of the company for every financial year comprised in the maximum engagement period (section 494ZA)`
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "who has been, or will have been, auditor ... for every financial year comprised in the maximum engagement period"
        IF `the company is a private company that is a public interest entity` EQUALS NOTHING
        THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the company is a public interest entity (section 494A) is not known
        IF    `the first day of the financial year for which the appointment is proposed` AT LEAST `s 485C(1) the first day of the period of 4 years` `the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period`
          AND `the first day of the financial year for which the appointment is proposed` AT MOST `s 485C(1) the last day of the period of 4 years` `the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "may not be appointed as auditor of the company for any financial year which begins within the period of 4 years beginning with the day after the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period": the year begins outside that period (fork F15)

-- src:6749 | (2) A person who is a member of the same network as the auditor mentioned in subsection (1) may not be appointed as auditor of the company for any financial year which begins within the period of 4 years mentioned in that subsection.
-- src:6750 | (3) This section does not apply in relation to an Auditor General.
@ref s 485C(2) A member of the same network may not be appointed; s 485C(3) Auditor General (src:6749-6750)
GIVEN `the company is a private company that is a public interest entity` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the auditor mentioned in subsection (1) has been, or will have been, auditor of the company for every financial year comprised in the maximum engagement period (section 494ZA)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a member of the same network as that auditor` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period` IS A DATE
      `the first day of the financial year for which the appointment is proposed` IS A DATE
      `the appointment is of an Auditor General` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 485C(2) the person is barred as a member of the same network as the auditor mentioned in subsection (1)` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the appointment is of an Auditor General`
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This section does not apply in relation to an Auditor General" (subsection (3))
        IF NOT `the person is a member of the same network as that auditor`
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A person who is a member of the same network as the auditor mentioned in subsection (1) may not be appointed": the bar reaches a member of that network
        IF    `the company is a private company that is a public interest entity` EQUALS JUST FALSE
           OR (NOT `the auditor mentioned in subsection (1) has been, or will have been, auditor of the company for every financial year comprised in the maximum engagement period (section 494ZA)`)
        THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the auditor mentioned in subsection (1)": the person described in subsection (1) is not in that position (fork F15)
        IF `the company is a private company that is a public interest entity` EQUALS NOTHING
        THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the company is a public interest entity (section 494A) is not known
        IF    `the first day of the financial year for which the appointment is proposed` AT LEAST `s 485C(1) the first day of the period of 4 years` `the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period`
          AND `the first day of the financial year for which the appointment is proposed` AT MOST `s 485C(1) the last day of the period of 4 years` `the last day of the last financial year of the maximum engagement period`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "for any financial year which begins within the period of 4 years mentioned in that subsection": the year begins outside that period

